Package: samplewise
Title: Sample-Level Statistical Inference for Derived Single-Cell Features
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Dayuan", "Wang", , "dayuan.wang.stats@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: One design formula across cell-type composition, pseudobulk
    differential expression, cell-cell communication strength and other
    features derived from single-cell RNA-seq, with the biological sample
    (mouse, donor, patient) as the unit of inference. Provides a per-sample
    long-table contract, builders that turn the outputs of standard tools
    into that contract, one fitting layer with explicit eligibility rules
    and Benjamini-Hochberg correction per feature family and contrast, and
    one report. Extracted from the replicate-aware framework of Wang (2026),
    Chapter 3.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/dayuan-wang/samplewise
BugReports: https://github.com/dayuan-wang/samplewise/issues
